{"n": 1170, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1170.webp", "text": "TROUBLESHOOTING ECONOMY CONTROL\n\n62 - 61\n\n— In neutral (car stopped — engine running) EC will always show the highest fuel consumption.\n\n— In the coasting phase there will be no fuel injection and consequently EC shows zero consumption.\n\nCondition\n\nUnrealistic display (e,9. only 6 liters for wide open\nthrottle in 4th gear)\n\nEC display too high\n\nNo display\n\nNeedle wanders in neutral\n\nNeedle wanders when using light switch or headlight flasher\n\n* See Specifications\n\n— Coding plug wrong\n— Coding plug broken\n— Temperature error on quartz\n- Coding plug wrong\n\n— Injection signal missing\n— Loose plug connection\n— Measuring mechanism failure (mech. defect)\n\nCorrection\n— Chock or replace coding plug”\n\n— Tachometer with economy control\n- See coding plug table\"\n\n— Check injection signal on instrument cluster plug (blue)\npin2\n\n— Check plug connection\n\n— Replace tachometer with economy control\n\n— Disconnect black wire of term, 1 on instrument cluster\nplug, pull wire out of wire harness and wrap it around\nthe wire harness.\n\n— Replace low beam relay\n(only install a diode relay, Part No, 61 31 1 373 154)", "words": [["TROUBLESHOOTING", 0.0461, 0.0703, 0.155, 0.0822], ["ECONOMY", 0.1596, 0.071, 0.2153, 0.0829], ["CONTROL", 0.2188, 0.0716, 0.2736, 0.0836], ["62", 0.4716, 0.0279, 0.5355, 0.0531], ["-", 0.4985, 0.0252, 0.5081, 0.063], ["61", 0.5152, 0.0279, 0.5355, 0.0531], ["—", 0.0461, 0.1406, 0.0522, 0.1432], ["In", 0.0578, 0.1353, 0.0669, 0.1459], ["neutral", 0.0709, 0.1353, 0.1028, 0.1459], ["(car", 0.1074, 0.1346, 0.1241, 0.1472], ["stopped", 0.1277, 0.1353, 0.1651, 0.1485], ["—", 0.1692, 0.1412, 0.1758, 0.1432], ["engine", 0.1793, 0.1359, 0.2107, 0.1492], ["running)", 0.2138, 0.1359, 0.2543, 0.1499], ["EC", 0.2584, 0.1359, 0.2725, 0.1472], ["will", 0.2756, 0.1359, 0.2928, 0.1472], ["always", 0.2974, 0.132, 0.3283, 0.1538], ["show", 0.3323, 0.132, 0.3521, 0.1538], ["th